ClipForge — iPhone-friendly web app starter

Deploy:
1. Upload this project to a GitHub repository.
2. In Render, choose New > Web Service and connect the repository.
3. Render will use Dockerfile. Deploy.
4. Open the deployed URL on iPhone Safari. Use Share > Add to Home Screen.

Features: upload video, choose duration and number of clips, generate evenly-spaced vertical clips, download.
Important: This starter does NOT extract video from YouTube URLs or detect AI highlights. It processes uploaded videos you own or are authorized to edit.
This starter may require persistent storage / job limits / access controls before public production use. Do not upload private videos to a public server.
